-- title:
--   Finite data for the 1000-prime sieve certificate
-- statement:
--   This module records an explicit list Qlist of 1000 natural numbers, the rational weight KR(d), its rounded integer WC(d), and a candidate integer table WP(d). The weight KR(d) is the product of (p-1)/(p-2) over distinct odd prime divisors of d, and WC(d) is the ceiling of 1000 KR(d). WP(d) extracts the d-th base-8192 digit from a fixed natural number. These definitions impose no assertion that the list consists of primes or that the table is sound: those properties and the finite sum bound are certified by separate theorems.
